entity.utilitycraft:power_condenser.name=Power Condenser Matrix
ui.utilitycraft:info.crusher_controller=Processes Crusher recipes in 1-3 chained stages. A higher mode keeps crushing the result from the previous stage.\n\n§8Slots:\n- §9Input Grid§8: materials.\n- §cOutput Grid§8: final products.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more items per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.
ui.utilitycraft:info.incinerator_controller=Smelts registered furnace recipes in parallel using §sDorios Energy§8.\n\n§8Slots:\n- §9Input Grid§8: items to smelt.\n- §cOutput Grid§8: smelted products.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more items per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.
ui.utilitycraft:info.electro_press_controller=Presses registered materials in parallel using §sDorios Energy§8.\n\n§8Slots:\n- §9Input Grid§8: materials to press.\n- §cOutput Grid§8: pressed products.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more items per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.
ui.utilitycraft:info.autosieve_controller=Sieves registered blocks with reusable Meshes. Mesh tier unlocks drops; its modifiers improve chance and amount. Each Mesh in the slot supports 9 blocks per cycle, so stack more when Processing can handle more.\n\n§8Slots:\n- §9Material Grid§8: blocks to sieve.\n- §bMesh§8: reusable filter.\n- §cOutput Grid§8: generated drops.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more blocks per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.
ui.utilitycraft:info.infuser_controller=Combines a base material with a catalyst using registered Infuser recipes.\n\n§8Slots:\n- §bCatalyst Grid§8: recipe reagent.\n- §9Material Grid§8: base items.\n- §cOutput Grid§8: infused products.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more recipes per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.
ui.utilitycraft:info.reaction_chamber_controller=Combines items with a liquid reactant. A recipe may produce items, liquid, or both.\n\n§8Storage:\n- §9Input Grid§8: materials.\n- §9Reactant Tank§8: input liquid.\n- §cOutput Grid§8: item products.\n- §cProduct Tank§8: output liquid.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more reactions per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.\n- Fluid Cells: larger tanks; capacity is shared equally.\n\n§8Heavy Water: requires 4 Lapis Lazuli per batch. Converts 8,000 mB Water into 1,000 mB Heavy Water, with a base recipe cost of 64,000 DE.
ui.utilitycraft:info.magmatic_chamber_controller=Melts registered items into liquid. The output tank must be empty or already contain the same liquid.\n\n§8Storage:\n- §9Input Grid§8: materials to melt.\n- §cOutput Tank§8: molten product.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Processing Modules: more items per cycle.\n- Speed Modules: faster work, but higher energy use.\n- Efficiency Modules: lower energy use.\n- Energy Cells: more §senergy§8 storage.\n- Fluid Cells: larger output tank.
ui.utilitycraft:info.power_condenser=Stores Dorios Energy and automatically supplies the connected network.\n\nAdd more or higher-tier Power Condenser Units for more storage and faster transfer.
ui.utilitycraft:info.thermo_reactor=Burns lava to generate §sDorios Energy§8. A higher burn rate produces more energy and heat. Efficiency is best near the ideal temperature; overheating can destroy the reactor.\n\n§8Tanks:\n- §bCoolant§8: removes heat.\n- §vLava Fuel§8: powers the reactor.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Energy Units: more storage and transfer.\n- Fluid Cells: more lava capacity.\n- Empty space: more coolant capacity.\n- Heat Conductors: stronger cooling.\n- Top Vents: release pressure.\n\n§8Use the keypad to set burn rate and Power to start or stop.
ui.utilitycraft:info.nuclear_reactor=Consumes Enriched Uranium Fuel Rods to generate §sDorios Energy§8. Fuel Assemblies increase internal fuel capacity and theoretical reaction speed. Each Rod Control efficiently manages up to four Fuel Assemblies; additional assemblies reduce control efficiency until more controls are installed.\n\n§8Resources:\n- §aNuclear Fuel§8: insert Enriched Uranium Rods in the fuel slot or through an Item Port.\n- §bCoolant§8: any registered coolant removes heat and is consumed while cooling.\n\n§8Structure:\n- Empty space: more coolant capacity.\n- Fuel Assemblies: more fuel capacity and reaction speed.\n- Rod Controls: efficiently control four assemblies each.\n- Heat Conductors: stronger coolant-based cooling.\n- Energy Cells: more storage and transfer.\n\n§8Use the keypad to set fuel consumption in FU/t and Power to start or stop.
