howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p1=Build the starting platform with §eBronze Casings§r, matching the shape shown in the render.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p2=Begin the walls and place the §bLiquid Port§r and §eEnergy Port§r where pipes and cables will feed the machine.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p3=Place §e4 Liquid Cells§r.\nThese define the machine's internal liquid storage.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p4=Add §e5 Energy Cells§r to give the machine power capacity.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p5=Place §e9 Efficiency Modules§r so the machine does not consume as much energy.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p6=Add §e4 Processing Modules§r so it can take and process more items per cycle.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p7=Distribute §e5 Speed Modules§r to increase the machine's §brate speed§r and make it run faster.
howtoplay.heavy_machinery.magmatic_chamber_build.p8=Finish the outer casing, place the §eItem Port§r and the §econtroller§r.\nThen use the §eWrench§r on the controller and you're done: if the structure is correct, the §6Magmatic Chamber§r activates.

entity.utilitycraft:isotope_centrifuge.name=Isotope Centrifuge
ui.utilitycraft:info.isotope_centrifuge=§8Separates Natural Uranium Hexafluoride into Enriched and Depleted Uranium Hexafluoride.\n\n§8Input: 1,000 mB Natural UF6\nOutput 1: 250 mB Enriched UF6\nOutput 2: 750 mB Depleted UF6\nBase cost: 16.384 MDE\n\n§8The High-Speed Rotor is used to craft the machine. No item is required during processing.\n\n§8All three gas tanks hold 32,000 mB. Both outputs must have space and compatible gas types. Progress is retained if energy is missing or an output is full. Extract both gases into standard gas tanks.\n\n§8Supports Speed and Energy upgrades and per-face gas I/O. Energy capacity: 65.536 MDE.
ui.utilitycraft:io.isotope_centrifuge.gases=Gas I/O modes:\n§r- §8Default\n§r- §9Input\n§r- §cOutput 1\n§r- §6Output 2\n§r- §dDrain Input\n§r- §eDisabled

